                "title": "Grade 1 Bethpage Single Cylinder Deadbolt, Baldwin 8237",
                "description": "Baldwin 8237 Bethpage Single Cylinder Deadbolt - This single cylinder deadbolt has old world beauty. Baldwin's Bethpage door lock features a beveled edge rose that only adds to the classic allure. It meets ANSI Grade 1 requirements, featuring a specially designed strike with four security jamb screws and a armored front to conceal the fasteners. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches and will fit 2-1/8 inch door preparation.",
